    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583760/extras/929937aae3ad3e9fed5f3f81cf3519f8.avif?t=1724866123\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br>Story: <br>The evil never sleeps, it just wants one thing, its power back. Stop it and search in the Dungeon after artefacts. But be aware, it\u2019s getting more dangerous the deeper you get. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583760/extras/9563319638fd0c9622c082dbf23dc8a1.avif?t=1724866123\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br>Procedural generated floors: <br>The World of Louma will be generated procedural. Fight the enemies and find a way to your destination. Search after keys, artefacts and collect resources. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583760/extras/1c54342f12697a3843434202eaba8fa3.avif?t=1724866123\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br>Categories: <br>In the beginning there are different categories between you can choose. Each category has its individual abilities. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583760/extras/6701a37102a2410abc139589551df8d7.avif?t=1724866123\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br>Upgrade your character: <br>You can upgrade your weapon and buy potions to get a better level. Your level defines your life/power.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583760/extras/929937aae3ad3e9fed5f3f81cf3519f8.avif?t=1724866123\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br>Story: <br>The evil never sleeps, it just wants one thing, its power back. Stop it and search in the Dungeon after artefacts. But be aware, it\u2019s getting more dangerous the deeper you get. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583760/extras/9563319638fd0c9622c082dbf23dc8a1.avif?t=1724866123\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br>Procedural generated floors: <br>The World of Louma will be generated procedural. Fight the enemies and find a way to your destination. Search after keys, artefacts and collect resources. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583760/extras/1c54342f12697a3843434202eaba8fa3.avif?t=1724866123\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br>Categories: <br>In the beginning there are different categories between you can choose. Each category has its individual abilities. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583760/extras/6701a37102a2410abc139589551df8d7.avif?t=1724866123\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br>Upgrade your character: <br>You can upgrade your weapon and buy potions to get a better level. Your level defines your life/power.",
